          "name": "Get Master Report",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Master Report",
            "description": {
              "content": "> ⚠️ Important\n>\n> All API V2 tokens generated before March 10, 2026, 19:00 UTC have been revoked. If your token was generated before this date, please regenerate it. [Learn how](https://support.appsflyer.com/hc/en-us/articles/360004562377-Managing-AppsFlyer-tokens).\n",
